      "end": 35.72,
      "text": "真正让你卡壳的是",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09594298507037916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00024"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.72,
      "end": 38.12,
      "text": "你脑袋里藏着一个信念",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09594298507037916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00025"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.12,
      "end": 41.1,
      "text": "一个可能你从来都没有认真审视过的信念",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09594298507037916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00026"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.1,
      "end": 44.0,
      "text": "那就是男人好色是不好的",
